==History==
2024 
*The Wall Breakers' Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 14/2/2024.
*On 14/5/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/5/2024)|Balance Update]] decreased Runner's damage by 50%, increased the Runner's movement speed to 120 (from 90), now classified as Very Fast, and removed the Evolved Wall Breaker's damage boost.
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]] added a sound effect to the Evolved Wall Breakers after death.
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]] increased the Evolved Wall Breakers' death damage by 50%, but made it so that the Evolved Wall Breakers' death damage would deal 66% of its full damage to [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Towers]].
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]] decreased the Evolved Wall Breakers' hitpoints by 0.3%, and their damage by 0.25%.
*On 1/4/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (1/4/2025)|maintenance break]] fixed a bug where [[Electro Wizard]] could nullify Wall Breakers' Evolutions' death effects.
*On 6/10/2025, increased Troop death damage by 11%.
*On 3/11/2025,  a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/6/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Wall Breakers’ death damage by 10% and it decreased the runner’s death damage by 7%.
2026

* On 6/4/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Evolved Wall Breakers' damage to troops by 26%
* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Evolved Wall Breakers’ death damage by 20%

