==Trivia== 
*The Wall Breakers were the first {{Rarity|Epic}} [[Cards|card]] to receive a [[Card Evolution]].
*The Evolved Wall Breakers' design, locomotion (rolling on a large, explosive barrel), and the fact that the barrel deals death damage, are all based on the Super Wall Breaker from Clash of Clans.
*The Wall Breakers are 1 of 6 evolved [[cards]] associated with [[Skeletons]], with the others being [[Bomber/Evolution|Bomber]], [[Skeleton Barrel/Evolution|Skeleton Barrel]], [[Witch/Evolution|Witch]], [[Skeleton Army/Evolution|Skeleton Army]], and of course, [[Skeletons/Evolution|Skeletons]].
*The Wall Breakers and Runners are 2 of 4 evolved [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] to die as part of its attack, the others being the [[Ice Spirit/Evolution|Ice Spirit]] and Skeleton Barrel.
**When the Evolved Wall Breakers are defeated before they connect to a [[:Category:Building Cards|building]], the Runners will play the Wall Breakers' battle cry.
*The Wall Breakers and Runners are 2 of 5 evolved troops which can defeat themselves in one attack, the others being Skeletons, [[Firecracker/Evolution|Firecracker]], and [[Goblin Barrel/Evolution|Decoy Goblins]].
**Unlike the others, the Evolved Wall Breakers and Runners cannot target other Evolved Wall Breakers or Runners respectively.
**The Wall Breakers and Runners are 2 of 3 evolved troops with more damage than hitpoints, with the other being Decoy Goblins.
*In the French, Korean, Arabic, Chinese, Malaysian, Thai, and Vietnamese language settings of the game, the Wall Breakers' name translates to "Sappers", "Skeleton Assault", "Wall Destroyers", "Siege Bombers", "Fortress Breakers", "Wall Bombers", and "Siege Soldiers" respectively.
*The dynamite used by the Evolved Wall Breakers is the same held by the [[Goblin Demolisher]].
*Unlike other evolved troops, the Runners do not disintegrate into [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Resource_Buildings#Dark_Elixir Dark Elixir] when defeated. Instead, they disintegrate into [[Elixir]]. This trait is shared with the Decoy Goblins.
*The Wall Breakers' Evolution is the subject of 2 [[Emotes]].
*Before the Wall Breakers' Evolution card was released, the Evolved Wall Breaker's death damage was decreased by 50%, the Runners' damage was increased by 100%, and the Runners' speed was decreased to 90 (from 120), now classified as Fast.

